1
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:48,120
Rich people like you

2
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:50,460
must have lost all your worries long ago.

3
00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,320
I don't have worries.

4
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:54,400
I only have annoyance right now.

5
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,780
Because of Yue Shanchuan?

6
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:01,530
What exactly do you like about him?

7
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:04,720
His face and body.

8
00:01:06,120 --> 00:01:08,600
There are plenty of handsome guys
with good faces and bodies.

9
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:10,120
Why get hung up on just one?

10
00:01:14,039 --> 00:01:15,170
But he's different.

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,120
Sometimes,

12
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:17,680
I feel like

13
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:20,120
he's an unyielding bamboo.

14
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:22,320
But then he inadvertently reveals

15
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:23,760
a hint of softness.

16
00:01:27,200 --> 00:01:28,560
Don't you think

17
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:30,840
he's especially cute

18
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:33,600
when he's all serious yet
looking so miserable and bitter?

19
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:35,400
Don't laugh. Don't you think so?

20
00:01:36,479 --> 00:01:37,360
I think...

21
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:39,720
falling for

22
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:42,120
a broke, broken,
and miserable little puppy

23
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,840
is the destiny of rich people like you.

24
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:45,440
I've finally figured it out.

25
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:50,759
But I'm sure he's into me.

26
00:01:53,479 --> 00:01:55,759
Even though I haven't known
Yue Shanchuan for long,

27
00:01:55,759 --> 00:01:57,360
I feel like

28
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:59,620
he takes relationships very seriously.

29
00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,360
If he won't accept you,

30
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:04,200
it must be because he can't handle
the gap between you two.

31
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:07,800
He's afraid he can't treat you
well enough or take responsibility.

32
00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:09,639
I don't need him to take responsibility.

33
00:02:09,639 --> 00:02:11,960
The gap between us is unavoidable.

34
00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,360
If he were smart,

35
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:17,440
he'd seize the opportunity to climb up

36
00:02:17,440 --> 00:02:19,160
while I still like him.

37
00:02:20,720 --> 00:02:21,780
Then let me ask you,

38
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:23,960
if he did that,

39
00:02:24,079 --> 00:02:25,840
how would he be any different
from Yue Yingying?

40
00:02:25,840 --> 00:02:28,170
You wouldn't have fallen for him, either.

41
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:32,560
That's true.

42
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,160
Think about it.

43
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:49,240
Yun.

44
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:51,120
Excuse me, who is this?

45
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:53,040
It hasn't been that long since you quit.

46
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,280
Have you forgotten your Mr. Hu?

47
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,560
Hu the dog... No, no, no, Mr. Hu.

48
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:58,800
I heard you opened a B&B

49
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:00,330
after leaving the company.

50
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,600
We all saw your ads.

51
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:06,160
Our department is having
a team building event these two days.

52
00:03:06,160 --> 00:03:08,320
Can you arrange it at your place?

53
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,920
My place is really too small

54
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,040
to host you, Mr. Hu.

55
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:13,240
I know.

56
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,480
Your little place

57
00:03:14,480 --> 00:03:17,120
doesn't meet the company's
team building standards.

58
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,400
But as your former boss,

59
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:21,440
I definitely need to support you.

60
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,000
No, Mr. Hu,

61
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,320
my place is really...

62
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,850
No need to thank me too much.

63
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,040
We're here. Open the door.

64
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,960
Look, a swimming pool.

65
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,160
Not bad, not bad.

66
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:36,360
It's worth the trip.

67
00:03:36,360 --> 00:03:37,320
Hurry up.

68
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,600
Great, great.

69
00:03:40,680 --> 00:03:43,000
Yun, you've done a good job here.

70
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:45,360
You truly are my protégé.

71
00:03:45,360 --> 00:03:47,560
Doing great wherever you go.

72
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,960
By the way, is your promotion still on?

73
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,079
Sorry,

74
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,000
the promotion is over.

75
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,160
Yun,

76
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,600
don't be so rigid.

77
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,160
It makes no sense to turn away

78
00:04:01,160 --> 00:04:02,360
customers,

79
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,200
right?

80
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:06,360
You're a veteran of the company.

81
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,800
You know our department's

82
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,130
team-building budget.

83
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,720
How about this?

84
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:15,850
I'll make the call
and give you the entire budget.

85
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:18,560
We'll just hang out here for three days.

86
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,560
Just get us three rooms.

87
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,560
You can keep

88
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,440
the extra money.

89
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:26,600
Consider it my support for your startup.

90
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,440
Thank you for your kindness, Mr. Hu.

91
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:33,360
But your budget

92
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:36,040
isn't enough to cover
three rooms for three days.

93
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,200
I'm just an employee.

94
00:04:37,200 --> 00:04:38,360
I don't call the shots,

95
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,159
and I can't explain it to my boss.

96
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,620
How about this?

97
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:46,400
Book a discounted room
for the two of them.

98
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,560
They're girls.

99
00:04:47,640 --> 00:04:49,170
A big room might scare them.

100
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:52,320
Besides, it's pretty cool
in the mountains.

101
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:54,120
A window doesn't really matter.

102
00:04:57,440 --> 00:04:58,360
Mr. Hu, Yun,

103
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,760
Same old problem.

104
00:05:00,840 --> 00:05:02,520
You only say no when facing issues.

105
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:04,360
You need to find a way to solve them.

106
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:07,220
You won't accomplish anything
anywhere like this.

107
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,690
Where are your waiters?

108
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:12,400
Are you the only one here?

109
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,520
Waiter!

110
00:05:14,960 --> 00:05:16,480
Who says there are no waiters?

111
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,920
I am the waiter.

112
00:05:18,960 --> 00:05:20,080
So blind.

113
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:20,880
We've been here a while.

114
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:22,720
You didn't even come
help with the luggage.

115
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,560
Hurry up

116
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,090
and take it upstairs for us.

117
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:28,440
What are you waiting for?

118
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,840
An invitation? Hurry up.

119
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:32,760
Not bad,

120
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,520
really not bad.

121
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:35,050
Let's go check out the pool.

122
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:40,080
Tell you what,
let me show you to your room.

123
00:05:40,080 --> 00:05:40,760
Okay.

124
00:05:41,520 --> 00:05:43,580
It's fine. We can carry it ourselves.

125
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,560
I don't care.

126
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,040
Right here.

127
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:03,200
Qingqing, did you open the wrong room?

128
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:04,560
No.

129
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:06,560
Some people would do anything

130
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:08,000
to save money,

131
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:10,660
but we don't have
discount rooms at Yunbian.

132
00:06:10,680 --> 00:06:12,400
We can't let you lose money.

133
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,780
We'll make up the difference.

134
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:16,760
Yeah, it's not easy
for you to start a business.

135
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:18,490
We can't take advantage of you.

136
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:19,840
No need.

137
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:21,680
It's not peak season anyway.

138
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,760
The room is empty,

139
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:25,000
so just stay here.

140
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,480
You must be exhausted

141
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,360
from the long ride.

142
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,560
Get some rest first.

143
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,640
Let me know if you need anything.

144
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,320
Don't let those two know,

145
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,040
or Mr. Hu will complain again.

146
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:40,640
Got it. If he can't take advantage,
he feels like he's losing out.

147
00:06:41,440 --> 00:06:42,570
I'll get going then.

148
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:43,800
Bye.

149
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,159
Who's that guy?

150
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:50,400
Acting like he owns the place.

151
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,330
He was my direct supervisor
at my old company.

152
00:06:53,440 --> 00:06:55,840
He loves bossing junior staff around

153
00:06:55,840 --> 00:06:57,560
and throwing his weight around.

154
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,920
But thanks for bailing me out today.

155
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:02,240
If he knew I was a one-woman show,

156
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:03,960
he'd laugh his head off.

157
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,360
I wasn't bailing you out.

158
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:07,620
I really want to be a waitress at Yunbian.

159
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,400
I've thought it through.

160
00:07:10,400 --> 00:07:12,680
If Yue Shanchuan won't come to my world,

161
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:14,640
I'll go check out his.

162
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:17,840
I want to see
what's so different about it.

163
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,440
Are you serious?

164
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:28,440
Do you have any normal clothes
I can borrow?

165
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:33,240
You have a whole closet of clothes,

166
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:34,400
yet you still want to borrow from me?

167
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:36,400
No, my clothes are all too expensive.

168
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,880
Yue Shanchuan definitely won't buy it.

169
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:40,159
I still need to borrow
a couple of ordinary ones from you

170
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,490
to keep up appearances.

171
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,680
I can't believe
I still couldn't escape that menace

172
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,680
after coming to Xinchang.

173
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:55,960
He has no other skills

174
00:07:56,159 --> 00:07:58,640
but sucking up and making empty promises.

175
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,240
He takes all the credit

176
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:03,880
and makes me take the blame
for all the mistakes.

177
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:05,560
He brags to the bosses

178
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:07,280
all day long,

179
00:08:07,440 --> 00:08:10,640
and then turns around and exploits us
to clean up his mess.

180
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:13,160
It's just the bitter tears
of a corporate slave.

181
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,560
He fired me just to make room

182
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,760
for his niece, Hu Yuqian.

183
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,240
But I feel like this girl

184
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:20,880
isn't the same kind of person as him.

185
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,480
Can you handle it alone?

186
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:23,840
Do you need my help?

187
00:08:23,840 --> 00:08:24,960
I'm fine.

188
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,400
Different strokes for different folks.

189
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:27,520
I know that scumbag Hu's tricks

190
00:08:27,520 --> 00:08:29,080
like the back of my hand.

191
00:08:29,120 --> 00:08:30,920
Don't worry, I can counter them.

192
00:08:31,640 --> 00:08:34,200
Okay, just call me anytime if you need me.

193
00:08:34,200 --> 00:08:35,720
Or you can ask Shanchuan if he has time

194
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,720
for a part-time job lately.

195
00:08:38,880 --> 00:08:40,480
Speaking of your buddy Yue Shanchuan,

196
00:08:40,480 --> 00:08:42,080
he's really an incubus reincarnated.

197
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:44,600
He's got our Shurong completely bewitched.

198
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:46,160
She gave up being a proper lady

199
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:47,490
just to suffer for love.

200
00:08:47,640 --> 00:08:49,560
She said she's packing her bags tonight

201
00:08:49,560 --> 00:08:51,240
to move into Yue Shanchuan's rental.

202
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:53,200
Shanchuan isn't that kind of casual guy.

203
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,880
If Shurong just wants
to play around with him,

204
00:08:54,880 --> 00:08:56,200
he'll never agree.

205
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,280
I advise Shurong

206
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,720
to give up on that idea.

207
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,800
Not necessarily.

208
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:03,080
Our Ms. Shu has the looks

209
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:04,440
and the figure.

210
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,840
Even a saint's heart

211
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,280
would skip a beat.

212
00:09:07,360 --> 00:09:09,920
Alright, let's make a bet today.

213
00:09:09,960 --> 00:09:10,880
Let's bet on whether Shurong

214
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:13,480
can successfully get into
Shanchuan's rental.

215
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,240
How about it?

216
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,200
What are the stakes?

217
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:18,640
If you win,

218
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,000
I'll give you a shard.

219
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,160
And if I lose?

220
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:23,720
If you lose,

221
00:09:24,200 --> 00:09:25,160
give me a kiss.

222
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,840
I treat you with sincerity,

223
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,120
and you play mind games with me?

224
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:31,960
Stingy.

225
00:09:32,640 --> 00:09:33,640
If you lose,

226
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:34,720
cook me a meal.

227
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:35,960
Is that okay?

228
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,880
If I win,

229
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:43,440
one shard isn't enough. I want ten.

230
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:45,680
Deal. Let's wait and see.

231
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,960
Tangbao, let's go.

232
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:55,120
Tangbao, time to go home.

233
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:57,840
Going home!

234
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:17,720
Did you work overtime today?

235
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,840
Why are you just coming out?

236
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,170
What are you doing here?

237
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,480
Seeking refuge with you.

238
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,320
Didn't I ruin

239
00:10:29,320 --> 00:10:30,960
my dad and Yue Yingying's affair?

240
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:32,360
He went back and

241
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,200
made up some nonsense,

242
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:35,200
making my mom freeze all my cards.

243
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:36,720
I don't have a single penny

244
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,200
on me right now.

245
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,800
I can't even afford to stay
at Yunbian anymore.

246
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:42,040
If you don't take me in,

247
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:46,040
I might have to sleep
on the streets tonight.

248
00:10:48,680 --> 00:10:49,440
Still no.

249
00:10:51,680 --> 00:10:52,600
If it weren't for your sister,

250
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:54,440
I wouldn't be so miserable.

251
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,850
You have to pay for what she did.

252
00:10:58,480 --> 00:10:59,360
Sorry.

253
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:02,520
It's really not convenient at my place.

254
00:11:07,640 --> 00:11:08,200
No.

255
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:13,690
Little girl,

256
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:16,380
what are you doing here all alone?

257
00:11:16,400 --> 00:11:19,040
It's late. It's dangerous not to go home.

258
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,410
Let me take you home.

259
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,000
What are you doing? Don't touch me.

260
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,280
Still shy, huh? It's okay.

261
00:11:25,280 --> 00:11:26,440
I'll take you home.

262
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:27,200
Let's go.

263
00:11:27,440 --> 00:11:28,500
What are you doing?

264
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:31,640
Get lost.

265
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:37,560
Let's go home.

266
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:46,340
It's so stuffy after taking a shower.

267
00:11:47,200 --> 00:11:48,720
The AC isn't cooling very well.

268
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,850
I'll turn on the fan.

269
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:50,930
It'll be cooler.

270
00:12:04,760 --> 00:12:05,820
What are you doing?

271
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:07,540
Aren't we sleeping together?

272
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,560
I'll just sleep on the floor.

273
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:18,700
It's not like
we haven't slept together before.

274
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,440
Go to sleep.

275
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:32,460
It's getting late.

276
00:12:37,760 --> 00:12:38,560
Go to sleep.

277
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,860
How can you sleep
on a bamboo mat in silk clothes?

278
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,680
Take them off.

279
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:06,920
What are you doing?
